[
  {
    "id": "c1",
    "startMs": 520,
    "endMs": 5340,
    "text": "Unit 2. Exercise for listening."
  },
  {
    "id": "c2",
    "startMs": 6980,
    "endMs": 8640,
    "text": "1. Listen and circle."
  },
  {
    "id": "c3",
    "startMs": 14950,
    "endMs": 18040,
    "text": "1. I'm going to have a party this Saturday."
  },
  {
    "id": "c4",
    "startMs": 21480,
    "endMs": 25160,
    "text": "2. Please take your game card to get a stamp."
  },
  {
    "id": "c5",
    "startMs": 25620,
    "endMs": 32240,
    "text": "3. It's not hard to fly a kite on windy days."
  },
  {
    "id": "c6",
    "startMs": 35900,
    "endMs": 39580,
    "text": "4. I am going to buy a bar of chocolate."
  },
  {
    "id": "c7",
    "startMs": 43130,
    "endMs": 45660,
    "text": "2. Listen and write."
  },
  {
    "id": "c8",
    "startMs": 67030,
    "endMs": 71500,
    "text": "You can use two small sticks to spin a toy"
  },
  {
    "id": "c9",
    "startMs": 71500,
    "endMs": 74760,
    "text": "that consists of two bell-shaped cups connected"
  },
  {
    "id": "c10",
    "startMs": 75340,
    "endMs": 80080,
    "text": "by a thing axle with a string and you can make it jump up and down."
  },
  {
    "id": "c11",
    "startMs": 83640,
    "endMs": 87620,
    "text": "3. You hold a long stick to control a big"
  },
  {
    "id": "c12",
    "startMs": 87620,
    "endMs": 90720,
    "text": "cloth dragon and you need to follow the head"
  },
  {
    "id": "c13",
    "startMs": 90720,
    "endMs": 91440,
    "text": "to move."
  },
  {
    "id": "c14",
    "startMs": 94890,
    "endMs": 99300,
    "text": "4. You need a light toy with winds and a roll of thread."
  },
  {
    "id": "c15",
    "startMs": 100020,
    "endMs": 101420,
    "text": "On windy days you can fly"
  },
  {
    "id": "c16",
    "startMs": 101560,
    "endMs": 102340,
    "text": "in the sky."
  },
  {
    "id": "c17",
    "startMs": 106860,
    "endMs": 108540,
    "text": "Three, listen and circle."
  },
  {
    "id": "c18",
    "startMs": 109240,
    "endMs": 110380,
    "text": "Siao Tiang, her James,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c19",
    "startMs": 110800,
    "endMs": 112460,
    "text": "do you see Heng An Xian Chiu,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c20",
    "startMs": 112880,
    "endMs": 113300,
    "text": "Tin Hu Ying,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c21",
    "startMs": 113720,
    "endMs": 114960,
    "text": "Chun Chiu Chiu Chiu Da Dan?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c22",
    "startMs": 115990,
    "endMs": 116740,
    "text": "One,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c23",
    "startMs": 117460,
    "endMs": 119200,
    "text": "our school has a garden party."
  },
  {
    "id": "c24",
    "startMs": 119900,
    "endMs": 121330,
    "text": "On the 26th of September,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c25",
    "startMs": 122240,
    "endMs": 123640,
    "text": "there are many traditional games."
  },
  {
    "id": "c26",
    "startMs": 124600,
    "endMs": 124800,
    "text": "Really?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c27",
    "startMs": 125360,
    "endMs": 128220,
    "text": "I love Chinese Yo-Yo and tug of war."
  },
  {
    "id": "c28",
    "startMs": 129020,
    "endMs": 129860,
    "text": "Can I come with you?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c29",
    "startMs": 131320,
    "endMs": 131920,
    "text": "Question."
  },
  {
    "id": "c30",
    "startMs": 132900,
    "endMs": 134300,
    "text": "What does James want to do?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c31",
    "startMs": 138110,
    "endMs": 140120,
    "text": "Two. James,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c32",
    "startMs": 141000,
    "endMs": 142420,
    "text": "what do you know about Chang Quan?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c33",
    "startMs": 143500,
    "endMs": 143840,
    "text": "Yes,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c34",
    "startMs": 144460,
    "endMs": 146860,
    "text": "it's the mother of many Kung Fu styles,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c35",
    "startMs": 147880,
    "endMs": 149980,
    "text": "and it has 12 kinds of actions."
  },
  {
    "id": "c36",
    "startMs": 150960,
    "endMs": 152120,
    "text": "Wow, that's cool."
  },
  {
    "id": "c37",
    "startMs": 152580,
    "endMs": 153640,
    "text": "I want to learn it."
  },
  {
    "id": "c38",
    "startMs": 154500,
    "endMs": 154680,
    "text": "Question."
  },
  {
    "id": "c39",
    "startMs": 155620,
    "endMs": 157780,
    "text": "What does James know about Chang Quan?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c40",
    "startMs": 161690,
    "endMs": 166820,
    "text": "3. Why do the students stop the Dragon Dance training?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c41",
    "startMs": 168340,
    "endMs": 170060,
    "text": "Min Min is the head of the Dragon."
  },
  {
    "id": "c42",
    "startMs": 171080,
    "endMs": 171960,
    "text": "He runs so fast."
  },
  {
    "id": "c43",
    "startMs": 172940,
    "endMs": 174720,
    "text": "The students at the tail of the Dragon"
  },
  {
    "id": "c44",
    "startMs": 175320,
    "endMs": 176240,
    "text": "can't keep up with him."
  },
  {
    "id": "c45",
    "startMs": 177120,
    "endMs": 178660,
    "text": "So they lose control of the sticks."
  },
  {
    "id": "c46",
    "startMs": 179900,
    "endMs": 180000,
    "text": "Question."
  },
  {
    "id": "c47",
    "startMs": 181040,
    "endMs": 183220,
    "text": "Why can't the Dragon Dance team do well?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c48",
    "startMs": 184680,
    "endMs": 190420,
    "text": "4. The Dragon Dance looks messy now."
  },
  {
    "id": "c49",
    "startMs": 191000,
    "endMs": 191600,
    "text": "Do you know why?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c50",
    "startMs": 192100,
    "endMs": 193700,
    "text": "No. Please tell me."
  },
  {
    "id": "c51",
    "startMs": 194340,
    "endMs": 195140,
    "text": "To play well,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c52",
    "startMs": 195860,
    "endMs": 197860,
    "text": "all the students at the Dragon's Head,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c53",
    "startMs": 198520,
    "endMs": 201060,
    "text": "body and tail need to work as a team."
  },
  {
    "id": "c54",
    "startMs": 202080,
    "endMs": 204520,
    "text": "Follow the music and the head of the Dragon."
  },
  {
    "id": "c55",
    "startMs": 205620,
    "endMs": 205860,
    "text": "Question."
  },
  {
    "id": "c56",
    "startMs": 207040,
    "endMs": 208800,
    "text": "What should the Dragon Dance team do?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c57",
    "startMs": 212320,
    "endMs": 215680,
    "text": "5. What's your favorite traditional game,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c58",
    "startMs": 215800,
    "endMs": 216240,
    "text": "Xiao Zhan?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c59",
    "startMs": 217040,
    "endMs": 217520,
    "text": "Kite flying."
  },
  {
    "id": "c60",
    "startMs": 218640,
    "endMs": 219160,
    "text": "It's exciting."
  },
  {
    "id": "c61",
    "startMs": 220540,
    "endMs": 222320,
    "text": "Do you need special things to play it?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c62",
    "startMs": 223200,
    "endMs": 227140,
    "text": "Yes. I need a big kite and a roll of strong thread."
  },
  {
    "id": "c63",
    "startMs": 228580,
    "endMs": 228740,
    "text": "Question."
  },
  {
    "id": "c64",
    "startMs": 230220,
    "endMs": 232700,
    "text": "What does Xiao Zhan need for her favorite game?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c65",
    "startMs": 234380,
    "endMs": 238660,
    "text": "4. Listen and complete."
  },
  {
    "id": "c66",
    "startMs": 244740,
    "endMs": 247560,
    "text": "Our class has a traditional game club"
  },
  {
    "id": "c67",
    "startMs": 248340,
    "endMs": 251000,
    "text": "and we meet every Wednesday afternoon after school."
  },
  {
    "id": "c68",
    "startMs": 252260,
    "endMs": 253800,
    "text": "The club has two main activities."
  },
  {
    "id": "c69",
    "startMs": 255280,
    "endMs": 257820,
    "text": "First, we learn to play Chinese yoyo."
  },
  {
    "id": "c70",
    "startMs": 259020,
    "endMs": 260960,
    "text": "Our teacher brings wood and yoyos and"
  },
  {
    "id": "c71",
    "startMs": 260960,
    "endMs": 263140,
    "text": "teaches us how to spin them with strings."
  },
  {
    "id": "c72",
    "startMs": 264600,
    "endMs": 267180,
    "text": "Many students think it's hard to play it at first,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c73",
    "startMs": 268280,
    "endMs": 270280,
    "text": "but they get better after more practice."
  },
  {
    "id": "c74",
    "startMs": 271680,
    "endMs": 271980,
    "text": "Second,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c75",
    "startMs": 272980,
    "endMs": 274660,
    "text": "we practice dragon dance together."
  },
  {
    "id": "c76",
    "startMs": 275880,
    "endMs": 277940,
    "text": "We each have a colourful dragon costume"
  },
  {
    "id": "c77",
    "startMs": 278960,
    "endMs": 280540,
    "text": "and take turns to be the head,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c78",
    "startMs": 281440,
    "endMs": 282460,
    "text": "body and tail"
  },
  {
    "id": "c79",
    "startMs": 282460,
    "endMs": 283200,
    "text": "of the dragon."
  },
  {
    "id": "c80",
    "startMs": 284300,
    "endMs": 286300,
    "text": "Sometimes we also play other games,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c81",
    "startMs": 287300,
    "endMs": 289140,
    "text": "like kite flying and tug of war."
  },
  {
    "id": "c82",
    "startMs": 290320,
    "endMs": 291020,
    "text": "For kite flying,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c83",
    "startMs": 291640,
    "endMs": 294500,
    "text": "we need a light kite and a roll of strong thread."
  },
  {
    "id": "c84",
    "startMs": 295460,
    "endMs": 298960,
    "text": "We usually fly kites in the playground when the wind is nice."
  },
  {
    "id": "c85",
    "startMs": 300180,
    "endMs": 300920,
    "text": "For tug of war,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c86",
    "startMs": 301460,
    "endMs": 303160,
    "text": "we use a long and thick rope,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c87",
    "startMs": 304120,
    "endMs": 305820,
    "text": "and each team has five students."
  },
  {
    "id": "c88",
    "startMs": 307160,
    "endMs": 309140,
    "text": "The club has a small reward rule."
  },
  {
    "id": "c89",
    "startMs": 310380,
    "endMs": 311620,
    "text": "If you finish a game well,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c90",
    "startMs": 312160,
    "endMs": 312760,
    "text": "you get a sticker."
  },
  {
    "id": "c91",
    "startMs": 314420,
    "endMs": 318340,
    "text": "Our goal is to help more students know and love traditional games."
  },
  {
    "id": "c92",
    "startMs": 319620,
    "endMs": 322700,
    "text": "Everyone in the club feels happy when we play together."
  },
  {
    "id": "c93",
    "startMs": 325680,
    "endMs": 327800,
    "text": "Our class has a traditional game club"
  },
  {
    "id": "c94",
    "startMs": 328540,
    "endMs": 331180,
    "text": "and we meet every Wednesday afternoon after school."
  },
  {
    "id": "c95",
    "startMs": 332480,
    "endMs": 333860,
    "text": "The club has two main activities."
  },
  {
    "id": "c96",
    "startMs": 335420,
    "endMs": 337920,
    "text": "First, we learn to play Chinese yo-yo."
  },
  {
    "id": "c97",
    "startMs": 339220,
    "endMs": 341160,
    "text": "Our teacher brings wood and yoyos and"
  },
  {
    "id": "c98",
    "startMs": 341160,
    "endMs": 343320,
    "text": "teaches us how to spin them with strings."
  },
  {
    "id": "c99",
    "startMs": 344780,
    "endMs": 347380,
    "text": "Many students think it's hard to play it at first,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c100",
    "startMs": 348480,
    "endMs": 350420,
    "text": "but they get better after more practice."
  },
  {
    "id": "c101",
    "startMs": 351900,
    "endMs": 352180,
    "text": "Second,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c102",
    "startMs": 353180,
    "endMs": 354860,
    "text": "we practice dragon dance together."
  },
  {
    "id": "c103",
    "startMs": 356080,
    "endMs": 358140,
    "text": "We each have a colourful dragon costume"
  },
  {
    "id": "c104",
    "startMs": 359180,
    "endMs": 360760,
    "text": "and take turns to be the head,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c105",
    "startMs": 361640,
    "endMs": 362660,
    "text": "body and tail"
  },
  {
    "id": "c106",
    "startMs": 362660,
    "endMs": 363400,
    "text": "of the dragon."
  },
  {
    "id": "c107",
    "startMs": 364500,
    "endMs": 366520,
    "text": "Sometimes we also play other games,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c108",
    "startMs": 367480,
    "endMs": 369340,
    "text": "like kite flying and tug of war."
  },
  {
    "id": "c109",
    "startMs": 370520,
    "endMs": 371220,
    "text": "For kite flying,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c110",
    "startMs": 371840,
    "endMs": 374700,
    "text": "we need a light kite and a roll of strong thread."
  },
  {
    "id": "c111",
    "startMs": 375660,
    "endMs": 379160,
    "text": "We usually fly kites in the playground when the wind is nice."
  },
  {
    "id": "c112",
    "startMs": 380380,
    "endMs": 381120,
    "text": "For tug of war,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c113",
    "startMs": 381660,
    "endMs": 383380,
    "text": "we use a long and thick rope,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c114",
    "startMs": 384300,
    "endMs": 386020,
    "text": "and each team has five students."
  },
  {
    "id": "c115",
    "startMs": 387380,
    "endMs": 389360,
    "text": "The club has a small reward rule."
  },
  {
    "id": "c116",
    "startMs": 390580,
    "endMs": 391820,
    "text": "If you finish a game well,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c117",
    "startMs": 392380,
    "endMs": 392960,
    "text": "you get a sticker."
  },
  {
    "id": "c118",
    "startMs": 394640,
    "endMs": 398560,
    "text": "Our goal is to help more students know and love traditional games."
  },
  {
    "id": "c119",
    "startMs": 399840,
    "endMs": 402900,
    "text": "Everyone in the club feels happy when we play together."
  },
  {
    "id": "c120",
    "startMs": 405960,
    "endMs": 406240,
    "text": "5."
  },
  {
    "id": "c121",
    "startMs": 406680,
    "endMs": 407520,
    "text": "Listen and choose."
  },
  {
    "id": "c122",
    "startMs": 434300,
    "endMs": 435920,
    "text": "We are very proud of you."
  },
  {
    "id": "c123",
    "startMs": 437500,
    "endMs": 438760,
    "text": "The join the kite flying game."
  },
  {
    "id": "c124",
    "startMs": 439780,
    "endMs": 441240,
    "text": "You need to bring your own kite."
  },
  {
    "id": "c125",
    "startMs": 442400,
    "endMs": 443390,
    "text": "The community provides"
  },
  {
    "id": "c126",
    "startMs": 443840,
    "endMs": 446620,
    "text": "extra threat if you forget to bring yours."
  },
  {
    "id": "c127",
    "startMs": 448180,
    "endMs": 448840,
    "text": "When the wind blows,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c128",
    "startMs": 449940,
    "endMs": 451240,
    "text": "the sky is full of colorful"
  },
  {
    "id": "c129",
    "startMs": 451240,
    "endMs": 455480,
    "text": "kites and everyone cheers when the kite flies high."
  },
  {
    "id": "c130",
    "startMs": 456660,
    "endMs": 459020,
    "text": "The most popular game is Dragon Dance."
  },
  {
    "id": "c131",
    "startMs": 460480,
    "endMs": 462760,
    "text": "people work together to control the dragon"
  },
  {
    "id": "c132",
    "startMs": 463310,
    "endMs": 465860,
    "text": "and they follow the drum music to move."
  },
  {
    "id": "c133",
    "startMs": 467140,
    "endMs": 467220,
    "text": "People"
  },
  {
    "id": "c134",
    "startMs": 467220,
    "endMs": 470000,
    "text": "love it because it makes them feel like a team."
  },
  {
    "id": "c135",
    "startMs": 471320,
    "endMs": 473320,
    "text": "Kids also enjoy Chinese yo-yo."
  },
  {
    "id": "c136",
    "startMs": 474180,
    "endMs": 474460,
    "text": "They"
  },
  {
    "id": "c137",
    "startMs": 474640,
    "endMs": 478000,
    "text": "laugh, toss and spin it fast with big smiles."
  },
  {
    "id": "c138",
    "startMs": 479480,
    "endMs": 480560,
    "text": "There are no big prices,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c139",
    "startMs": 481640,
    "endMs": 482520,
    "text": "but people get small"
  },
  {
    "id": "c140",
    "startMs": 482760,
    "endMs": 485780,
    "text": "gifts like pencils or bookmarks for joining."
  },
  {
    "id": "c141",
    "startMs": 487040,
    "endMs": 490000,
    "text": "Many people say they like the game day because"
  },
  {
    "id": "c142",
    "startMs": 490180,
    "endMs": 494500,
    "text": "they can play games happily and make new friends with neighbors."
  },
  {
    "id": "c143",
    "startMs": 495740,
    "endMs": 498780,
    "text": "It's always a happy day for the whole community."
  },
  {
    "id": "c144",
    "startMs": 501530,
    "endMs": 502860,
    "text": "Every month,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c145",
    "startMs": 502860,
    "endMs": 505820,
    "text": "our community holds a traditional game"
  },
  {
    "id": "c146",
    "startMs": 505820,
    "endMs": 508720,
    "text": "day for all the people in our community."
  },
  {
    "id": "c147",
    "startMs": 510040,
    "endMs": 510340,
    "text": "Kids,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c148",
    "startMs": 510980,
    "endMs": 512700,
    "text": "parents and grandparents can join."
  },
  {
    "id": "c149",
    "startMs": 513860,
    "endMs": 515820,
    "text": "The activity is in the community park,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c150",
    "startMs": 516640,
    "endMs": 519520,
    "text": "because there is enough space for all games."
  },
  {
    "id": "c151",
    "startMs": 520920,
    "endMs": 522720,
    "text": "There are many interesting games here."
  },
  {
    "id": "c152",
    "startMs": 523860,
    "endMs": 525160,
    "text": "To join the kite flying game,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c153",
    "startMs": 526100,
    "endMs": 527620,
    "text": "you need to bring your own kite."
  },
  {
    "id": "c154",
    "startMs": 528780,
    "endMs": 533000,
    "text": "The community provides extra threat if you forget to bring yours."
  },
  {
    "id": "c155",
    "startMs": 534500,
    "endMs": 535220,
    "text": "When the wind blows,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c156",
    "startMs": 536260,
    "endMs": 538400,
    "text": "the sky is full of colorful kites"
  },
  {
    "id": "c157",
    "startMs": 539340,
    "endMs": 541580,
    "text": "and everyone cheers when the kite flies"
  },
  {
    "id": "c158",
    "startMs": 541760,
    "endMs": 541920,
    "text": "high."
  },
  {
    "id": "c159",
    "startMs": 543280,
    "endMs": 545440,
    "text": "most popular game is Dragon Dance."
  },
  {
    "id": "c160",
    "startMs": 546540,
    "endMs": 549140,
    "text": "Eight people work together to control the dragon,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c161",
    "startMs": 550240,
    "endMs": 552240,
    "text": "and they follow the drum music to move."
  },
  {
    "id": "c162",
    "startMs": 553540,
    "endMs": 556380,
    "text": "People love it because it makes them feel like a team."
  },
  {
    "id": "c163",
    "startMs": 557740,
    "endMs": 559680,
    "text": "Kids also enjoy Chinese yo-yo."
  },
  {
    "id": "c164",
    "startMs": 560760,
    "endMs": 561180,
    "text": "They laugh,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c165",
    "startMs": 561760,
    "endMs": 564360,
    "text": "toss and spin it fast with big smiles."
  },
  {
    "id": "c166",
    "startMs": 565900,
    "endMs": 566900,
    "text": "There are no big prices."
  },
  {
    "id": "c167",
    "startMs": 568220,
    "endMs": 569280,
    "text": "people get small gifts,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c168",
    "startMs": 570300,
    "endMs": 572200,
    "text": "like pencils or bookmarks for joining."
  },
  {
    "id": "c169",
    "startMs": 573460,
    "endMs": 575840,
    "text": "Many people say they like the game"
  },
  {
    "id": "c170",
    "startMs": 576020,
    "endMs": 577880,
    "text": "day because they can play games happily"
  },
  {
    "id": "c171",
    "startMs": 578980,
    "endMs": 580940,
    "text": "and make new friends with neighbours."
  },
  {
    "id": "c172",
    "startMs": 582160,
    "endMs": 583260,
    "text": "It's always a happy"
  },
  {
    "id": "c173",
    "startMs": 583260,
    "endMs": 585140,
    "text": "day for the whole community."
  }
]
